  "meta": {
    "title": "Web 服务与任务运行模型 · 单进程并发与演示回放体系",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "output": "docs/architecture/o5-web.html",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "legend": {
      "mode": "hidden"
    },
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "task-engine",
        "label": "任务引擎",
        "focus": [
          "browser",
          "task_mgmt",
          "executor",
          "event_bus",
          "realtime",
          "tasks_db",
          "checkpoints",
          "output"
        ],
        "note": "单进程:FastAPI 端点+执行器+事件总线+dist;Executor 并发=1 队列排队 fail-fast;SSE 先订阅再补历史、终态 15s 关流;任务/事件/检查点/产物本地持久化。"
      },
      {
        "id": "lifecycle",
        "label": "任务生命周期",
        "focus": [
          "queued",
          "running",
          "clarify",
          "completed",
          "cancelled",
          "error"
        ],
        "note": "queued→running→completed/cancelled/error;澄清中断挂起(15min 超时取消),resume 续跑;重启孤儿纠偏为 cancelled;终态清检查点。"
      },
      {
        "id": "replay-system",
        "label": "回放与样例导入",
        "focus": [
          "sample_pack",
          "importer",
          "replay_ep",
          "replayer",
          "replay_task",
          "resolver",
          "tasks_db",
          "result"
        ],
        "note": "启动幂等导入(同 id 仅升级 source=sample);回放=replay_of 新任务+事件节奏重演;重度数据端点经 _resolve_source_task 零拷贝映射回源。"
      }
    ]
  },
